    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Automatic continuous totaliser (belt weigher) designed to weigh large quantities of loose material from bulk to bulk. Comprises a weighing platform type MSI or MMI, a speed sensor, and an integrator type BW 500. The MMI weighing platform comprises two or three MSI weighing platforms installed in succession. Load cells are single-ended beam (bending) G4-TBSP models manufactured by Group Four Transducers as described in OIML Certificate of Conformity R60/2000-GB-01.02. Provided devices: main totalising device, semi-automatic zero-setting device, indication of flow rate (Q), indication of belt speed, indication of totalised weight, error messages and alarms. Interfaces: load cell connection (hardwired), speed sensor, RS232, RS485, digital I/O, Modbus connection."
